# Conformance probe pack for `rest` inside a `length` block counted in bits
# (spec 0.21 rulings 3 and 5), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   block       an 8-bit length in bits: recs to the end of the block, x in 4
#               bits and y in 4 bits each, read while at least 1 bit remains
format     conformance-extents-bits
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
length 8 bits
  group  probe.recs rest
    field  probe.x  4  uint
    field  probe.y  4  uint
  end
end
